    "type_designations": ["sonico EDGE"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Ultrasonic water meters type sonico EDGE designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. They consist of a cast iron body with connecting screw threads, one pair of ultrasonic transducers and an electronic indicating device formed by an LCD display showing volume and flow, with volume resolution of 0.0001 m³ and 0.001 m³. Without buttons; legally non-relevant communication via optical sensor on the register. Software is separated; SW versions and CRCs are shown in the auto-rounding menu on the LCD display. Each volume indication is displayed every two minutes, separately for reverse flow and forward flow; the permanently shown delivered volume is the difference between the two. An optional impulse module is not part of this certificate. Powered from mains 24 V DC with an internal battery for temporary power failure; mains power cable shielding via magnetic ferrite. Installed to operate in arbitrary positions."
